Then open <http://127.0.0.1:5000> — a Todo list, server-rendered with
Jinja2. Adding, checking off, and deleting a todo all happen without a
full page reload — each action is an HTMX request that swaps in just
the HTML fragment that changed (see `src/{{ package_name }}/routes/todos.py`
and `src/{{ package_name }}/templates/`).

